questions.question:
The following IAM policy is attached to an IAM group. Group members have no other policies. Which action can a user in this group perform immediately after signing in to the console without MFA?

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "DenyWithoutMFA",
      "Effect": "Deny",
      "NotAction": [
        "iam:CreateVirtualMFADevice",
        "iam:EnableMFADevice",
        "iam:GetUser",
        "iam:ListMFADevices",
        "iam:ResyncMFADevice",
        "sts:GetSessionToken"
      ],
      "Resource": "*",
      "Condition": {
        "BoolIfExists": {
          "aws:MultiFactorAuthPresent": "false"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

